# rp2350-touch-lcd-154-platform

The Waveshare RP2350 LCD 1.54 family: two boards for four SKUs, and the
board-owned providers they bind. rp2350_lcd_154 is the RP2350-LCD-1.54 and its
-EN battery option, with an ST7789 colour panel, a QMI8658 inertial sensor, and
an ES8311 codec; rp2350_touch_lcd_154 is the RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54 and its -EN
option, which derives from it and adds a CST816 touch controller.

Each provider owns its own wiring and nothing else. The device drivers are
portable modules under modules/mm, and the boards are the only place that
knows which pin is which. The audio provider, which is platform code rather
than board description, lives under platforms/pico/rp2350_touch_lcd_154/audio.
